---
title: "4. Job record lifecycle — every path terminates"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> queued: conditional create

  queued --> running: conditional claim on version
  running --> succeeded: object, then terminal write
  running --> failed: exit 2, permanent
  running --> failed: budget of 3 exhausted
  running --> queued: exit 137 or deadline, lease released
  running --> queued: worker died, lease expires
  queued --> failed: sweeper, stale lease
  queued --> failed: DLQ drained

  succeeded --> [*]: webhook
  failed --> [*]: webhook

  note right of running
    Two counters, not one:
    stored attempt is the budget,
    receiveCount is the backstop.
  end note
